只要第一层 key：`jq -r 'keys[]' in.json`

Python：
```python
import json
def walk(o,p=''):
    if isinstance(o,dict):
        for k,v in o.items(): yield from walk(v,p+'.'+k if p else k)
    elif isinstance(o,list):
        for i,v in enumerate(o): yield from walk(v,f'{p}[{i}]')
    else: yield p
print('\n'.join(walk(json.load(open('in.json')))))
```
